{"error": false, "page": 1, "prepage": 100, "pageCount": 1, "recordCount": 43, "data": [{"docid2": 2233444, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "其他会议", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zyhy/qthy/qthy/202607/t20260702_2233444.htm", "content": "　　7月1日，市委副书记、市长陈岳峰主持召开市政府专题会议，研究推进省委巡视反馈意见整改，以及群众身边不正之风和腐败问题集中整治工作。市领导杨国昕、林菁、廖金辉、游文杰参加。\n　　陈岳峰强调，要深入学习贯", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202607/t20260702_2233444.htm", "docreltime": "2026.07.02 08:22:00", "doctitle": "市政府召开专题会议", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 3, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2446397, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "研究推进政府系统巡视整改和群腐整治工作", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202607/t20260702_2233444.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202607/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2208777, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "其他会议", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zyhy/qthy/qthy/202605/t20260523_2208777.htm", "content": "　　5月22日，市委副书记、市长陈岳峰主持召开市政府专题会议，研究推进民生热点问题专项整治工作。副市长廖金辉、游文杰参加。\n　　陈岳峰强调，要深入学习贯彻习近平总书记关于保障和改善民生的重要论述，扎实开展", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202605/t20260523_2208777.htm", "docreltime": "2026.05.23 09:15:00", "doctitle": "市政府召开专题会议研究推进民生热点问题专项整治工作", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 3, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2420268, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202605/t20260523_2208777.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202605/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2196737, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "其他会议", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zyhy/qthy/qthy/202603/t20260326_2196737.htm", "content": "　　3月25日，市政府党组书记、市长陈岳峰主持召开市政府党组“牢记嘱托、感恩奋进”专题学习会、市政府重点政策研究工作专题会，以习近平总书记来明考察5周年为契机，深学细悟习近平总书记关于树立和践行正确政绩观", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202603/t20260326_2196737.htm", "docreltime": "2026.03.26 08:58:00", "doctitle": "市政府党组“牢记嘱托、感恩奋进”专题学习会和市政府重点政策研究工作专题会召开", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 3, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2408306, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202603/t20260326_2196737.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202603/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2192471, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "其他会议", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zyhy/qthy/qthy/202603/t20260305_2192471.htm", "content": "　　3月4日，市政府召开廉政工作会议，贯彻落实国务院、省政府廉政工作会议精神，对全市政府系统党风廉政建设和反腐败工作进行再部署、再推动。市政府党组书记、市长陈岳峰出席会议并讲话。市委常委、市纪委书记、市", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202603/t20260305_2192471.htm", "docreltime": "2026.03.05 08:26:00", "doctitle": "市政府召开廉政工作会议", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 3, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2401359, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202603/t20260305_2192471.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202603/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2183449, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "其他会议", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zyhy/qthy/qthy/202601/t20260113_2183449.htm", "content": "　　根据省委、市委部署要求，1月12日，市政府召开2025年度党员领导干部述责述廉会。市政府党组书记、市长陈岳峰主持会议，并对市政府班子成员述责述廉情况逐一进行点评。\n　　陈岳峰强调，要深入学习贯彻习近平总书", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202601/t20260113_2183449.htm", "docreltime": "2026.01.13 09:00:00", "doctitle": "市政府召开党员领导干部述责述廉会", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 3, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2401358, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202601/t20260113_2183449.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202601/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2175897, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "其他会议", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zyhy/qthy/qthy/202512/t20251211_2175897.htm", "content": "　　12月9日，市政府召开专题会议，研究推进“十五五”城市更新专项规划编制和城市工作。市委副书记、市长陈岳峰出席会议并讲话，在家市政府领导参加。\n　　陈岳峰强调，要深入学习贯彻习近平总书记关于城市工作的重", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202512/t20251211_2175897.htm", "docreltime": "2025.12.11 09:08:00", "doctitle": "市政府召开城市更新专题会议", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 3, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2401357, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202512/t20251211_2175897.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202512/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2165652, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "其他会议", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zyhy/qthy/qthy/202510/t20251031_2165652.htm", "content": "\n　　10月30日，市委副书记、市长陈岳峰主持召开市政府专题会，研究部署“两重”“两新”和“十四五”规划收官工作。市领导杨国昕、胡帅、钟科、吴健成参加。\n　　陈岳峰强调，要深入学习贯彻党的二十届四中全会精神", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202510/t20251031_2165652.htm", "docreltime": "2025.10.31 08:47:00", "doctitle": "市政府召开专题会议——推进“两重”“两新”工作和“十四五”规划收官", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 3, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2369358, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202510/t20251031_2165652.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202510/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2150459, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "其他会议", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zyhy/qthy/qthy/202508/t20250829_2150459.htm", "content": "\n　　8月27日，市委副书记、市长陈岳峰主持召开全市经济分析会议，按照省委、省政府工作要求，分析研判当前经济运行形势，研究部署下阶段工作。市领导杨国昕、林菁、廖金辉参加。\n　　陈岳峰强调，各级各部门要坚定信", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202508/t20250829_2150459.htm", "docreltime": "2025.08.29 08:52:00", "doctitle": "全市经济分析会议召开", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 3, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2356839, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202508/t20250829_2150459.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202508/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2146063, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "其他会议", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zyhy/qthy/qthy/202508/t20250813_2146063.htm", "content": "\n　　8月12日，市委副书记、市长陈岳峰主持召开全市持续优化营商环境专题会议，深入学习贯彻习近平总书记关于优化营商环境的重要论述，部署推动营商环境持续优化。市领导杨国昕、张元明、吴健成参加。\n　　陈岳峰充分", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202508/t20250813_2146063.htm", "docreltime": "2025.08.13 08:33:00", "doctitle": "全市持续优化营商环境专题会议召开", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 3, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2356838, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202508/t20250813_2146063.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202508/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2136469, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "其他会议", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zyhy/qthy/qthy/202507/t20250704_2136469.htm", "content": "\n　　7月2日，市委副书记、市长陈岳峰主持召开市政府专题会议，深入学习贯彻习近平总书记在部分省区市“十五五”时期经济社会发展座谈会上的重要讲话和对“十五五”规划编制工作作出的重要指示精神，部署推进“十五五", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202507/t20250704_2136469.htm", "docreltime": "2025.07.04 09:39:00", "doctitle": "市政府专题研究“十五五”规划编制工作", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 3, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2336073, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202507/t20250704_2136469.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202507/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2102076, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "其他会议", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zyhy/qthy/qthy/202502/t20250223_2102076.htm", "content": "\n　　2月21日，市政府召开廉政工作会议，贯彻落实国务院、省政府廉政工作会议精神，对全市政府系统党风廉政建设和反腐败工作进行再部署、再推动。市政府党组书记、市长陈岳峰出席会议并讲话。市领导杨国昕、林菁、柳", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202502/t20250223_2102076.htm", "docreltime": "2025.02.23 13:12:00", "doctitle": "市政府召开廉政工作会议", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 3, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2295306, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202502/t20250223_2102076.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202502/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2095878, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "其他会议", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zyhy/qthy/qthy/202501/t20250120_2095878.htm", "content": "\n　　1月19日，市长陈岳峰主持召开市政府专题会议，贯彻落实省政府专题会议精神，研究部署下一阶段经济工作、春节前后稳工稳产及清理拖欠企业账款工作，确保实现一季度良好开局。市领导杨国昕、胡帅、张元明、柳建忠", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202501/t20250120_2095878.htm", "docreltime": "2025.01.20 09:05:00", "doctitle": "市政府召开专题会议", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 3, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2288687, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "研究部署下一阶段经济工作及春节前后稳工稳产等工作", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202501/t20250120_2095878.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202501/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2093564, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "其他会议", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zyhy/qthy/qthy/202501/t20250110_2093564.htm", "content": "\n　　1月9日，在市两会闭幕后，市政府紧接着召开2025年第一次全体会议，动员全市各级政府各部门着力拼作风、拼干劲、拼担当，比效率、比实绩、比贡献，奋勇争先、再上台阶，以实际行动践行对全市人民作出的庄严承诺。", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202501/t20250110_2093564.htm", "docreltime": "2025.01.10 14:56:00", "doctitle": "2025年市政府第一次全体会议召开", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 3, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2285245, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202501/t20250110_2093564.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202501/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2070278, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "其他会议", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zyhy/qthy/qthy/202410/t20241018_2070278.htm", "content": "\n　　10月17日，市政府召开招商工作视频会议，传达贯彻省招商引资工作领导小组第四次会议精神，部署推动全市招商引资工作。市长李春出席会议并讲话。市领导杨国昕、胡帅、张元明、廖金辉参加。\n　　李春强调，要在把", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202410/t20241018_2070278.htm", "docreltime": "2024.10.18 08:23:00", "doctitle": "三明市政府招商工作视频会议召开", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 3, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2256380, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202410/t20241018_2070278.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202410/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2056316, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "其他会议", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zyhy/qthy/qthy/202408/t20240831_2056316.htm", "content": "\n　　8月30日，市长李春主持召开市政府专题会议，对全市优化营商环境攻坚行动再推进、再部署、再落实。市委常委、常务副市长杨国昕参加。\n　　李春充分肯定了各有关单位在推进优化营商环境攻坚行动中取得的阶段性成效", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202408/t20240831_2056316.htm", "docreltime": "2024.08.31 19:09:00", "doctitle": "市政府召开优化营商环境工作专题会议", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 3, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2239735, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202408/t20240831_2056316.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202408/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2055392, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "其他会议", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zyhy/qthy/qthy/202408/t20240829_2055392.htm", "content": "\n　　8月28日，市委常委、常务副市长杨国昕召开市政府外贸工作专题会议，分析存在问题，提出针对性措施，推动全市外贸出口企稳回升。\n　　会议强调，各级各有关部门要保持奋发有为的工作状态，不甘人后、实干善拼，躬", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202408/t20240829_2055392.htm", "docreltime": "2024.08.29 08:38:00", "doctitle": "市政府外贸工作专题会议召开", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 3, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2238576, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202408/t20240829_2055392.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202408/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2044531, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "其他会议", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zyhy/qthy/qthy/202407/t20240720_2044531.htm", "content": "\n　　7月19日，市长李春主持召开市政府专题会议，听取全市生物医药产业链发展情况，研究解决有关困难问题，推进生物医药产业发展提质增效。副市长钟科参加。\n　　李春强调，当前我市生物医药产业正处于“爬坡过坎”的", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202407/t20240720_2044531.htm", "docreltime": "2024.07.20 12:15:00", "doctitle": "市政府召开生物医药产业发展专题会议", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 3, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2222363, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202407/t20240720_2044531.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202407/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2043586, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "其他会议", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zyhy/qthy/qthy/202407/t20240717_2043586.htm", "content": "\n　　7月16日，市长李春主持召开市政府专题会议，听取第十八届省运会筹备工作进展情况汇报，协调解决有关事项，进一步推动筹备工作走深走实。市委副书记杨兴忠、副市长廖金辉参加。\n　　李春强调，承办好省运会是省委", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202407/t20240717_2043586.htm", "docreltime": "2024.07.17 08:55:00", "doctitle": "市政府召开专题会议研究推进第十八届省运会筹备工作", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 3, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2221153, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202407/t20240717_2043586.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202407/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2027614, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "其他会议", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zyhy/qthy/qthy/202405/t20240522_2027614.htm", "content": "\n　　5月21日下午，市长李春赴市防汛抗旱指挥中心，主持召开防汛备汛专题会议，研究会商当前防汛形势，细化部署下阶段工作。\n　　李春详细了解了近期全市天气变化趋势，听取气象、水文会商和预警预报工作情况汇报，她", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202405/t20240522_2027614.htm", "docreltime": "2024.05.22 10:40:00", "doctitle": "市政府召开防汛备汛专题会议", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 3, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2202968, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202405/t20240522_2027614.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202405/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2025499, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "其他会议", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zyhy/qthy/qthy/202405/t20240515_2025499.htm", "content": "\n　　5月14日，市长李春主持召开法治政府建设专题会议，深入贯彻落实习近平法治思想，推动法治政府建设走深走实。市委常委、副市长王军强出席会议。\n　　李春强调，法治政府建设是一项长期的系统工程，各级各部门要提", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202405/t20240515_2025499.htm", "docreltime": "2024.05.15 09:59:00", "doctitle": "市政府召开法治政府建设专题会议", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 3, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2200342, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202405/t20240515_2025499.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202405/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2017273, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "其他会议", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zyhy/qthy/qthy/202404/t20240412_2017273.htm", "content": "\n　　4月11日，市长李春主持召开市政府专题会议，推动全市营商环境持续优化提升。市领导王军强、杨国昕、张元明、柳建忠、钟科、郑剑波出席会议。\n　　李春强调，优化营商环境，没有哪个部门是“二线部门”，没有哪个", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202404/t20240412_2017273.htm", "docreltime": "2024.04.12 10:31:00", "doctitle": "市政府召开优化营商环境工作专题会议", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 3, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2190830, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202404/t20240412_2017273.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202404/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1999869, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "其他会议", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zyhy/qthy/qthy/202402/t20240203_1999869.htm", "content": "\n　　2月2日，市长李春主持召开市政府专题会议，研究推进财源培植和财政增收节支工作。市领导杨国昕、张元明、廖金辉、钟科参加会议。\n　　李春强调，要着力强根基，锚定高质量发展主线，狠抓特色产业链“延链补链强", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202402/t20240203_1999869.htm", "docreltime": "2024.02.03 15:34:00", "doctitle": "市政府召开专题会议", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 3, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2169957, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202402/t20240203_1999869.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202402/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1994167, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "其他会议", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zyhy/qthy/qthy/202401/t20240113_1994167.htm", "content": "\n　　1月12日上午，市两会刚闭幕，市政府紧接着召开2024年第一次全体会议，动员各级政府各部门增强争优、争先、争效意识，当好抓落实的执行者、行动派、实干家，全力推动政府工作报告确定的各项目标任务落到实处，以", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202401/t20240113_1994167.htm", "docreltime": "2024.01.13 11:45:00", "doctitle": "2024年市政府第一次全体会议召开", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 3, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2163328, "sourcename": "三明市融媒体中心", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202401/t20240113_1994167.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [{"appdesc": "2024年市政府第一次全体会议召开.mp4", "appdocid": 1994167, "appfile": "P020240115350969728769.mp4", "appflag": 10, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202401/t20240113_1994167.htm", "fileext": "mp4", "_src": "/protect/P0202401/P020240115/P020240115350969728769.mp4", "_href": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202401/P020240115350969728769.mp4"}], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202401/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1992653, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "其他会议", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zyhy/qthy/qthy/202401/t20240109_1992653.htm", "content": "\n　　1月8日，市长李春主持召开市政府专题会议，研究推动一季度“开门红”工作。市领导王军强、杨国昕、林菁、廖金辉、柳建忠、钟科、郑剑波参加。\n　　李春强调，要深入贯彻中央和省委、市委经济工作会议精神，坚定", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zyhy/qthy/qthy/202401/t20240109_1992653.htm", "docreltime": "2024.01.09 08:50:00", "doctitle": "市政府召开专题会议", "docty