"http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zyhy/qthy/qthy/202310/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1976782, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "其他会议", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zyhy/qthy/qthy/202309/t20230922_1976782.htm", "content": "\n　　9月21日，市长李春主持召开市政府专题会议，贯彻落实省委省政府工作部署，研究推进我市县域重点产业链发展工作，促进县域经济高质量发展。副市长郭海阳参加。\n　　李春强调，县域经济是国民经济的基本单元，县域", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zyhy/qthy/qthy/202309/t20230922_1976782.htm", "docreltime": "2023.09.22 10:45:00", "doctitle": "市政府召开专题会议研究推进县域重点产业链发展工作", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2141608, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zyhy/qthy/qthy/202309/t20230922_1976782.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zyhy/qthy/qthy/202309/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1976781, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "其他会议", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zyhy/qthy/qthy/202309/t20230902_1976781.htm", "content": "\n　　研究推进三明经开区和三明高新区有关工作\n　　9月1日，市长李春主持召开市政府专题会议，听取三明经开区、高新区园区整合提升工作进展汇报，协调解决有关困难和问题，推动园区高质量发展。市领导杨兴忠、郭海阳", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zyhy/qthy/qthy/202309/t20230902_1976781.htm", "docreltime": "2023.09.02 13:24:00", "doctitle": "市政府召开专题会议", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2141607, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zyhy/qthy/qthy/202309/t20230902_1976781.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zyhy/qthy/qthy/202309/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1976780, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "其他会议", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zyhy/qthy/qthy/202307/t20230708_1976780.htm", "content": "\n　　7月7日，市长李春主持召开市政府专题会议，分析研判全市校园安全形势，部署推动未成年人保护工作。市领导王军强、郑隆松、林菁、柳建忠参加会议。\n　　李春指出，做好未成年人保护工作，是各级政府义不容辞的政", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zyhy/qthy/qthy/202307/t20230708_1976780.htm", "docreltime": "2023.07.08 10:13:00", "doctitle": "市政府召开专题会议​研究加强未成年人保护暨校园安全工作", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2141606, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zyhy/qthy/qthy/202307/t20230708_1976780.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zyhy/qthy/qthy/202307/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1976779, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "其他会议", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zyhy/qthy/qthy/202307/t20230705_1976779.htm", "content": "\n　　7月4日，市长李春主持召开市政府专题会议，研究部署林票和林业碳汇改革有关工作，推动三明林改走深走实。市领导郑剑波参加会议。\n　　李春指出，持续深化三明林改、积极探索生态产品价值实现机制，是习近平总书", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zyhy/qthy/qthy/202307/t20230705_1976779.htm", "docreltime": "2023.07.05 08:49:00", "doctitle": "市政府召开专题会议研究推动三明林改工作", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2141605, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zyhy/qthy/qthy/202307/t20230705_1976779.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zyhy/qthy/qthy/202307/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1976778, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "其他会议", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zyhy/qthy/qthy/202304/t20230426_1976778.htm", "content": "\n　　4月25日，市政府召开重点工作视频会议，部署推进全市招商引资、优化营商环境工作。会议分两个阶段进行，市长李春出席会议并讲话，市领导赖碧涛、杨兴忠、林菁、郑剑波分别参加会议。\n　　李春指出，近年来全市招", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zyhy/qthy/qthy/202304/t20230426_1976778.htm", "docreltime": "2023.04.26 10:32:00", "doctitle": "市政府召开重点工作视频会议", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "p