　　会议强调，要高度重视安全生产大检查工作，提高政治站位，切实增强", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zyhy/qthy/qthy/202204/t20220430_1976799.htm", "docreltime": "2022.04.30 10:11:00", "doctitle": "市政府召开专题会议", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2141628, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zyhy/qthy/qthy/202204/t20220430_1976799.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zyhy/qthy/qthy/202204/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1976798, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "其他会议", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zyhy/qthy/qthy/202201/t20220124_1976798.htm", "content": "\n　　1月20日下午，郭海阳副市长主持召开农业农村工作专题会议，研究分析当前农业农村工作形势，安排部署下阶段重点任务，市农业农村局、水利局、供销社等有关单位负责人和11个县（市、区）政府分管负责同志参加会议", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zyhy/qthy/qthy/202201/t20220124_1976798.htm", "docreltime": "2022.01.24 09:34:00", "doctitle": "市政府召开农业农村工作专题会议", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2141627, "sourcename": "三明市农业农村局网站", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zyhy/qthy/qthy/202201/t20220124_1976798.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zyhy/qthy/qthy/202201/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1747798, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "其他会议", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zyhy/qthy/qthy/202201/t20220109_1747798.htm", "content": "\n　　8日下午，市两会刚闭幕，市政府紧接着召开2022年第一次全体会议，动员全市各级政府各部门统一思想、振奋精神，时不我待、真抓实干，迅速贯彻落实市两会精神，以实际行动践行对全市人民作出的庄严承诺。市长李春", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202201/t20220109_1747798.htm", "docreltime": "2022.01.09 17:32:00", "doctitle": "2022年市政府第一次全体会议召开", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 3, 